# A Methodology for Determining Skills Needed in a Technical Career.

**Authors:** DeCaro, James J.

## Abstract
Describes the methodology, questionnaire package, and processing of a needs assessment technique to identify skills necessary for successful placement and employment of civil and architectural technicians (associate degree level), using data collected from representative firms. Actual employment skills must be considered in establishing technical curricula. (MF)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ197457

